{"unit_id":"ai-v5__LLMAgentChatRoom#feature-1","repo":"ai-v5/LLMAgentChatRoom","commit":"68b8fe3917599ac3c29e1f6aca6eb573c352ce47","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"LLMAgentChatRoom 的功能「DSH 会话入房」：让当前会话以成员身份加入指定房间，并启动房间消息接收。通过 room_join 工具触发，提供服务器、房间和邀请码。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-plugin/src/plugin.js:598-639"]}
{"unit_id":"ai-v5__LLMAgentChatRoom#feature-2","repo":"ai-v5/LLMAgentChatRoom","commit":"68b8fe3917599ac3c29e1f6aca6eb573c352ce47","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"LLMAgentChatRoom 的功能「房间消息收发」：DSH 会话可向已绑定房间发送文本，并按序读取消息历史。分别通过 room_send 和 room_read 工具触发，可附带唤醒目标或历史游标。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-plugin/src/plugin.js:642-729"]}
{"unit_id":"ai-v5__LLMAgentChatRoom#feature-3","repo":"ai-v5/LLMAgentChatRoom","commit":"68b8fe3917599ac3c29e1f6aca6eb573c352ce47","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"LLMAgentChatRoom 的功能「房间消息唤醒会话」：接收被房间标记为唤醒目标的消息，并将其作为带房间来源信息的用户消息推入对应 DSH 会话。由后台事件接收流程自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-plugin/src/plugin.js:394-412","packages/dsh-plugin/src/plugin.js:425-450"]}
{"unit_id":"ai-v5__LLMAgentChatRoom#feature-4","repo":"ai-v5/LLMAgentChatRoom","commit":"68b8fe3917599ac3c29e1f6aca6eb573c352ce47","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"LLMAgentChatRoom 的功能「侧边栏聊天室面板」：在 DSH Web 侧边栏注册聊天室入口，点击后打开内嵌房间界面，也可选择在新窗口打开。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-plugin/client.js:96-118","packages/dsh-plugin/client.js:198-212"]}
